# Local databases and secrets - the real app database now lives under
# ~/.caatmaster/ (see src/core/database.py), never inside the repo, but
# these patterns stay as a defense-in-depth backstop against a database,
# backup, or secret ever landing in the working tree again.
data/*.db
data/*.db-journal
data/*.sqlite
data/*.sqlite3
data/caatmaster_backup_*.db
*.pem
*.key
secret_key

# Markdown (except README.md)
*.md
!README.md
